WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Mara explains why the bridge keeper's memorial matters.

00:08.000 --> 00:17.000
Last Oath and Brace show the Knight's new status effects.

00:17.000 --> 00:35.000
Ordinary movement and server-validated attacks against a Briar Hound.

00:35.000 --> 00:55.000
The route crosses the bridge and passes another hound encounter.

00:55.000 --> 01:15.000
The memorial names Elian Voss and updates the return objective.
